    "htmlContent": "<h2>Interpretation</h2>\n<br><ul>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>5 – 15 µmol/L</strong> → Normal</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>15 – 30 µmol/L</strong> → Mild elevation</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>30 – 100 µmol/L</strong> → Moderate elevation</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>&gt; 100 µmol/L</strong> → Severe elevation</p>\n<br></li>\n<br></ul>"
