    "rawText": "Chronic Heart failure \nAGE OF PATIENTS  TITER Result\n<75 Year <125 Pg/ml Chronic heart failure unlikely\nYear <450 Pg/ml Chronic heart failure unlikely\n\n\n\n\nACUTE HEART FAILURE \nAGE OF PATIENTS  TITER Result\n<50 YEAR <450 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely\n50-75 YEAR <900 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely\nYEARS <1800 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely",
    "htmlContent": "<p><strong>Chronic Heart failure&nbsp;<br></strong>AGE OF PATIENTS &nbsp;TITER Result<br>&lt;75 Year &lt;125 Pg/ml Chronic heart failure unlikely<br>Year &lt;450 Pg/ml Chronic heart failure unlikely</p>\n<br><p><strong>ACUTE HEART FAILURE&nbsp;<br></strong>AGE OF PATIENTS &nbsp;TITER Result<br>&lt;50 YEAR &lt;450 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely<br>50-75 YEAR &lt;900 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely<br>YEARS &lt;1800 Pg/ml Acute heart failure unlikely</p>"
