    "rawText": "Reference Interpretation (Adults)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n< 0.2 → Normal\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n0.2 – 0.5 → Mild proteinuria\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n0.5 – 3.0 → Moderate proteinuria\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n> 3.0 → Nephrotic range proteinuria",
    "htmlContent": "<h3>Reference Interpretation (Adults)</h3>\n<br><ul>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>&lt; 0.2</strong> → Normal</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>0.2 – 0.5</strong> → Mild proteinuria</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>0.5 – 3.0</strong> → Moderate proteinuria</p>\n<br></li>\n<br><li>\n<br><p><strong>&gt; 3.0</strong> → Nephrotic range proteinuria</p>\n<br></li>\n<br></ul>"
